  pageTexts:
  - 15 years ago, a child visited his mother in an asylum.
  - That night, something terrifying happened.
  - The asylum was closed after an unexplained accident.
  - Years later, strange incidents begin again.
  - The police reopen the case.Now a detective sees a chance to return to the place
    that ruined his childhood.
  - He accepts the case, hoping to uncover the truth and finally face what happened.
